        (T('Data availability', 'Disponibilité des données'), T('The statement now cites a fixed release (v19.0) and lists the ERA5 series and both Monte Carlo sets; Table S6 adds scipy and the run time. The authors will publish Repository/ as release v19.0 before submitting, so the statement is accurate at submission.', 'La déclaration cite une version fixe (v19.0) ; les auteurs publieront Repository/ avant soumission.')),
